<title>UK: BT Q2 sales rise 5.0 pct -- a breakdown.</title>
<headline>BT Q2 sales rise 5.0 pct -- a breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is quarter on quarter breakdown of British Telecommunications Plc's business turnover, comparing the second quarter of this year with the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>					    Q2 96/7	Q2 95/6    change</p>
<p>					   mln stg	mln stg	  %</p>
<p> Inland telephone calls	     1,218	  1,181	 +3.1</p>
<p> International telephone calls	469	    496	 -5.4</p>
<p> Telephone exchange line rentals    700	    671	 +4.3</p>
<p> Private circuits			 265	    261	 +1.5</p>
<p> Mobile communications		  231	    220	 +5.0</p>
<p> Sales/rental of equipment (CPE)    226	    241	 -6.2</p>
<p> Yellow pages, other directories    116	    107	 +8.4</p>
<p> Other sales and services	     500	    372	+34.4</p>
<p> TOTAL				    3,725	  3,549	 +5.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7987</p>
